# Curious Minds website catalogue

This repository is the public site (`curiousminds.fairermind.com`), not the book-production tree.

A live Amazon listing is **not** a complete release until this site is updated. Follow `CuriousMindsBooks/docs/publishing/checklists/13-published.md` (workflow gates 23–26). Do not duplicate that checklist here.

When a book, edition, format, cover, description, or purchase link changes:

- Use the **approved published cover** (a web JPG derivative is allowed). Do not generate substitute cover art.
- Match the live Amazon title, description, and age range where established.
- Shop CTAs: `/go/amazon/<book-id>` from `data/catalogue.json` only — never raw Amazon URLs in page HTML.
- Test locally, then verify the live site after deploy.

*Shadow Adventures* (`CM-Y05to10-STO-SCI-SHADOWS`) is in `data/catalogue.json`. Keep every later live KDP title listed the same way.
